{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">世界劍擊錦標賽，港隊打入女子重劍團體賽八強。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">右方的港隊由佘繕妡率先登場，領先俄羅斯4-3。陳渭泠緊接，協助港隊稍稍帶開。到吳海諦開始，優勢更明顯，三局已領先7分。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.FENCING.EPEE.32.OS-1400_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026Zcu38JEAOy1785219950.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.FENCING.EPEE.32.OS-1400_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">她與佘繕妡，在個人賽都在32強出局，來到團體賽越戰越勇，反勝埃及之後，今場贏上屆亞軍俄羅斯45-40，八強對意大利。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T06:39:57.128694+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}